    "duration_raw": "instantaneous",
    "saving_throw_raw": "Will negates (harmless)",
    "spell_resistance_raw": "yes (harmless)",
    "description_raw": "You can free one or more creatures from the effects of temporary paralysis or related magic, including spells and effects that cause a creature to gain the staggered condition. If the spell is cast on one creature, the paralysis is negated. If cast on two creatures, each receives another Will save with a +4 resistance bonus against the effect that afflicts it. If cast on three or four creatures, each receives another Will save with a +2 resistance bonus.\n\nThe spell does not restore ability scores reduced by penalties, damage, or drain.",
